<div class="main">
			    <h2>Books</h2>

    <p>      <a href="http://www.amazon.com/Astrotomography-Indirect-Imaging-Observational-Astronomy/dp/3540422137/ref=sr_1_2?ie=UTF8&qid=1384032146&sr=8-2&keywords=Astrotomography">Astrotomography: Indirect Imaging Methods in Observational Astronomy</a>, Springer, 2001
  <br>H.M.J. Boffin, D. Steeghs, J. Cuypers (Eds.)</p>
  <p><a href="">The Future Astronuclear Physics: From Microscopic Puzzles to Macroscopic Nightmares</a>, Edp Sciences, 2004
  <br>Jorissen, Alain ; Goriely, Stéphane ; Siess, Lionel ; Rayet, Marc ; Boffin, Henri (Eds.)</p>
 <p><a href="images/pubcloud.png"><img src="images/pubcloud.png" width="400" padding="1px" alt="Publication cloud" style="float:right;vertical-align:top;margin:0px 0px"></a><a href="http://www.springer.com/astronomy/book/978-3-662-44433-7"> Ecology of Blue Straggler Stars</a>, Springer, 2014
<br>H.M.J. Boffin, G. Carraro, G. Beccari (Eds.)</p>
 <p><a href="http://www.springer.com/astronomy/book/978-3-319-39737-5"> Astronomy at High Angular Resolution</a>, Springer, 2016
<br>H.M.J. Boffin et al. (Eds.)</p>
 <p><a href="https://www.cambridge.org/core/books/impact-of-binary-stars-on-stellar-evolution/5F7496DDDE170B26657D66D5F742906E">The Impact of Binary Stars on Stellar Evolution</a>, Cambridge University Press, 2019
<br>G. Beccari and H.M.J. Boffin (Eds.)</p>
<p><a href="https://www.eso.org/sci/meetings/2019/FORS2019/FORS20thyear_low.pdf">FORS 20th Anniversary Book</a>, ESO, 2019
<br>H.M.J. Boffin</p>
 <p><a href="https://www.springer.com/de/book/9783030250584">The Importance of Binaries in the Formation and Evolution of Planetary Nebulae</a>, Springer, 2019
<br>H.M.J. Boffin and D. Jones</p>
 <p><a href="https://www.eso.org/sci/activities/garching/Hypatia/2021/ESOHypatia2021.pdf">Hypatia Colloquium 2021</a>, ESO, 2021
<br>G. Beccari and H.M.J. Boffin (Eds.)</p>
 <p><a href="https://www.eso.org/sci/activities/garching/Hypatia/2022/ESOHypatia2022.pdf">Hypatia Colloquium 2022</a>, ESO, 2022
<br>G. Beccari and H.M.J. Boffin (Eds.)</p>


